  "description": "A modern, lightweight, and AOT-ready .NET 10 client library for all things Civitai.com. Core package for the documented Public API. Provides type-safe, fluent builders for querying models, images, tags, and creators with built-in resilience, structured error handling, and first-class dependency injection support. CivitaiSharp is an independent open-source project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Civitai.com or Civitai, Inc.",
